  (text "U1 STM32G051K6U6 QFN-32" (at 86 60 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Place U1 here with:\n  C5 100nF + C6 100nF + C7 4u7 (VDD/VDDA decoupling)\n  R1 10k (NRST pull-up to 3.3V)" (at 86 61 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "LEFT SIDE INPUTS:" (at 35 48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) bold)))
  (text "PA0 ADC_IN0  WHITE rail sense   R8=15k/R9=4k7 divider\nPA1 ADC_IN1  BLACK track sense   R10=22k/R11=4k7 divider (track side of pass switch)\nPA3 ADC_IN3  Pot wiper (10k, CCW = min brake)\nPB0 GPIO in  Toggle bit0 (mode select), pull-up, active-LOW\nPB1 GPIO in  Toggle bit1 (mode select), pull-up, active-LOW\nPB3 GPIO     Reserved (optional reverse-switch enable; unused in Rev 11)" (at 15 32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "RIGHT SIDE OUTPUTS:" (at 120 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2) bold)))
  (text "PA4  DAC_CH1  Brake -> GD2 op-amp buffer -> Q2 (linear, no PWM)\nPA5  DAC_CH2  Anti-brake demand DC -> R_KA1/R_KA2 div -> GD3 LM7321 -> GD1 current source\nPB4  GPIO     TM1637 display CLK -> J14\nPA9  USART1_TX  UART debug/bootloader  115200 8N1\nPA10 USART1_RX  UART RX\nPA13 SWDIO      SWD\nPA14 SWDCLK     SWD + BOOT0 (J12 via series R, nBOOT_SEL=0)\nPB6  GPIO out   Status LED (blinks 3x on flash save)\nPB8  GPIO     TM1637 display DIO -> J14\nNRST            Reset input" (at 120 48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "TOGGLE DECODING (PB0=bit0, PB1=bit1, active-LOW pull-up):\nPB0=H PB1=H -> Mode A (brake only, all motors; pot linear)\nPB0=L PB1=H -> Mode B (brake + anti-brake, brushed; coupled tables)\nPB0=H PB1=L -> Mode C (keep-alive tuning, brushless setup)\nboth LOW    -> defaults to Mode A" (at 15 120 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "DUAL DAC (replaces TIM3 PWM gate drive):\nPA4 DAC_CH1 and PA5 DAC_CH2 drive op-amp buffers in LINEAR mode\n(no switching, no EMI). DAC2 polarity is now non-inverted:\ncode 0 = off, full = 3A current source. DAC output is DC; no PWM or RC filter. See doc 7A.7/11.1." (at 120 120 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
  (text "RAIL SENSE DIVIDERS:\nWHITE: R8=15k / R9=4k7 -> within 3.3V ADC at 16V rail\nBLACK: R10=22k / R11=4k7, tapped on the TRACK side of the pass switch" (at 120 140 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)))
)
